      "name": "test_bruteforce_small",
      "intent": "For grids with H <= 6 and W <= 6, compute the correct answer by trying all row permutations and column permutations (factorials) and checking if any yields a symmetric grid. Assert that the output matches this computed result. Skip larger grids."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_output_format",
